su name re-entry attempt to name text output be ceremony def
  su name draft out ob name task for name author to name text draft out by num 0 be write do
  su name review out ob name draft out for name reviewer to name text review out by num 0 be write do
  su name revised out ob name review out for name author to name text revised out by num 0 be write do
  su name revised out ret
prah

su name re-entry cycle fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 to name text output be ceremony def
  to name text latest be re-entry attempt do
  exists su name task ob text of latest be text ya
  su name latest ret
prah

exists su name re-entry attempt be export ya
exists su name re-entry cycle be export ya
